----                              942    ; [section code]
----                              943  ; Symbol scan covers punctuation, operators, comments, and prefixed numeric  ; [section code]
----                              944  ; forms. The structure intentionally parallels vm_scan_symbol_token() in Rust:  ; [section code]
----                              945  ; dispatch by lead byte, optionally consume a longer form, then commit the  ; [section code]
----                              946  ; canonical lexeme bytes through tokvmStageAndCommitSymbol.  ; [section code]
----                              947  tokvmScanSymbolToken  ; [section code]
----                              948          ; The dispatch order matters. More syntactically specific lead bytes are  ; [section code]
